# Premium TV — frozen wayfinding rule

On `premium.html` / `theme-premium`:

**Walk distance and walk time must stay on the platform side of the yellow safety line.**

- Never let those labels cross above the yellow line into the track/coach zone.
- Keep ±90° / ±270° rotation if already used, but clip them inside `.walk-strip` below the yellow line.
- Do not change this layout unless the user **explicitly** asks to move walk labels relative to the yellow line.

Related CSS is marked `FROZEN (premium)` in `coach-position/public/css/premium.css`.
